GET http://localhost:5000/api/database
Accept: application/json

### Inisiasi Google OAuth 2.0 (Redirect ke Google Consent Screen)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/google

### Inisiasi GitHub OAuth (Redirect ke GitHub Authorization)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/github

### Minta Reset Password (Lupa Password)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alimenriko@gmail.com"
}

### Verifikasi Token Reset
GET http://localhost:5000/api/verify-reset-token/PASTE_TOKEN_DISINI
Accept: application/json

### Simpan Password Baru
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_DISINI",
  "password": "PasswordBaru2026!",
  "confirmPassword": "PasswordBaru2026!"
}

### Update Profil Pengguna
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_DISINI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ALim Enriko"
}

### Ubah Password Pengguna (Verifikasi password saat ini & bcrypt hash)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/change-password
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_DISINI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "PasswordLama123!",
  "newPassword": "PasswordBaru2026!",
  "confirmPassword": "PasswordBaru2026!"
}

### Hapus Akun & Seluruh Tugas Milik Pengguna
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/account
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_DISINI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "PasswordSaatIni123!"
}
